      3 · the A/B. `Two Line` (triangle, PARKED) 1.000  vs  `Tremble` (sine,
          SWEPT) 1.000 — same machine, same line count, only the modulator
          shape differs. If the parked clause could not fail, these would be
          equal; they are not, and `Tremble` is carried by the crowd clause
          (4 copies) instead.
